eratorname{MLRandom}(X)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall U\\ [\\operatorname{MLtest}(U)\\Rightarrow X\\notin\\bigcap_nU_n].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}random}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall U\\ [\\operatorname{MLtest}(U)\\Rightarrow X\\notin\\bigcap_nU_n].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>必须通过所有有效检验。随机性并非对一个任意固定检验取补；通用检验的存在将在独立定理证明。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 11.1.1(3)–(4)；印刷页 190；PDF 第 221 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-ml-test","status":"resolved","id":"0f911a6b1b63f977","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-ml-test]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-ml-test","status":"resolved","id":"0f911a6b1b63f977","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-ml-test]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}random}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall U\\ [\\operatorname{MLtest}(U)\\Rightarrow X\\notin\\bigcap_nU_n].","display":true}],"bytes":950,"backlinks":[{"id":"84c39ea3efb71898","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-kurtz-random]]；see [[20-df-random]]；see [[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]；see [[20-df-ml-test]]；see [[20-thm-kurtz-test-equivalence]]；see [[20-thm-null-class-no-random]]。"},{"id":"d07bc20b7cf43ad2","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-random]]；see [[20-df-cantor-measure]]；see [[20-df-tail-shift]]；see [[20-lem-effective-prefix-free-cover]]；see [